    "group": "Weirdboy",
    "summary": "When you pick this unit to fight in the Fight phase, you may roll one D6 as a psychic roll if it is free of battle-shock. A 1 battle-shocks the unit. Taking the roll also lets the unit reroll melee wound rolls of 1 and gives its melee attacks [PSYCHIC]. This psychic ability can be used once each phase.",
